(1070167, 128836, 11467, '<td valign="top">Wow I''m touched. One of my images.<br/>After I took my image entry which was just a test shot, I saw it on my computer, &amp; noticed some aspects I didn''t like, so I spent the next 2 nights trying to reproduce it, but to no avail. <br/>Well done, Good focus, clean straws, nice crop.</td>', 'Wow I''m touched. One of my images.After I took my image entry which was just a test shot, I saw it on my computer, & noticed some aspects I didn''t like, so I spent the next 2 nights trying to reproduce it, but to no avail. Well done, Good focus, clean straws, nice crop.', '2004-12-20 07:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1070170, 129295, 12611, '<td valign="top">fantastic. I''ve heard you talk about this before- and I love th erandom nature of the whole concept and the original. now this is a ten.</td>', 'fantastic. I''ve heard you talk about this before- and I love th erandom nature of the whole concept and the original. now this is a ten.', '2004-12-20 07:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1070172, 129362, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot that more than does the original justice. It might look better if the background were solid black, rather than having slight splotches of blue, but, regardless, it''s still an excellent photo. Really nice job!</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot that more than does the original justice. It might look better if the background were solid black, rather than having slight splotches of blue, but, regardless, it''s still an excellent photo. Really nice job!', '2004-12-20 07:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1070176, 129318, 19952, '<td valign="top">Great job freezing the action for this fun photo. Really nice shot!</td>', 'Great job freezing the action for this fun photo. Really nice shot!', '2004-12-20 07:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
