(1070192, 129295, 18191, '<td valign="top">OK... this is a Ten... It is perfectly excecuted and I can see how much time and energy was spent doing this one.... especially the black in the middle --- perfect,,, Although the first expression can never quite be as priceless as the original, this is by far the best of the challenge. Homage to you and I hope everyone else gives you a ten too. I think i''m going to cry...</td>', 'OK... this is a Ten... It is perfectly excecuted and I can see how much time and energy was spent doing this one.... especially the black in the middle --- perfect,,, Although the first expression can never quite be as priceless as the original, this is by far the best of the challenge. Homage to you and I hope everyone else gives you a ten too. I think i''m going to cry...', '2004-12-20 08:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
