(1070402, 129462, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful, the lighting, the colors, the only thing I find a bit distracting is the light on the right, almost creates a double image and make a weird illusion.  A 9</td>', 'This is wonderful, the lighting, the colors, the only thing I find a bit distracting is the light on the right, almost creates a double image and make a weird illusion.  A 9', '2004-12-20 10:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
