(1070404, 128486, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very nice, inspired but unique.  I like the color chosen but the shadows on from the brush handle are a bit distracting.  A 9</td>', 'Very nice, inspired but unique.  I like the color chosen but the shadows on from the brush handle are a bit distracting.  A 9', '2004-12-20 10:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1070405, 128981, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very nice imitation, just how do you get the egg to balance and how many did you break before you got it? :)  A 9, the eggs in the bowl seem a bit fuzzy, I know DOF is in use but it seems like it goes from clear to fuzzy almost too quickly.  Still a 9 though</td>', 'Very nice imitation, just how do you get the egg to balance and how many did you break before you got it? :)  A 9, the eggs in the bowl seem a bit fuzzy, I know DOF is in use but it seems like it goes from clear to fuzzy almost too quickly.  Still a 9 though', '2004-12-20 10:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1070407, 129459, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very nice, very nice indeed.  I''m sitting here trying to fibure out how you did that, I can''t see where the paper was cut, certainly doesn''t looked photoshopped, excellent.  A 10</td>', 'Very nice, very nice indeed.  I''m sitting here trying to fibure out how you did that, I can''t see where the paper was cut, certainly doesn''t looked photoshopped, excellent.  A 10', '2004-12-20 10:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1070409, 129477, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love the word you decided to enlarge, very nice choise.  I would have liked to seen more of the heart shape itself but then again, you did a nice imitation with a little parody.  Wonder how many people will pick up on the word there?  An 8</td>', 'I love the word you decided to enlarge, very nice choise.  I would have liked to seen more of the heart shape itself but then again, you did a nice imitation with a little parody.  Wonder how many people will pick up on the word there?  An 8', '2004-12-20 10:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1070412, 129331, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very well done in deed!  Close to perfection but this type of shot, the blown out look always threw me a bit and the right leg looks off for some reason, looks a lot skinnier than the left leg.  An 8</td>', 'Very well done in deed!  Close to perfection but this type of shot, the blown out look always threw me a bit and the right leg looks off for some reason, looks a lot skinnier than the left leg.  An 8', '2004-12-20 10:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1070413, 129280, 12448, '<td valign="top">Hahaha, very cute!  Is there a blue ribbon under that tail and were any lions or cats hurt in  the process?  An 8</td>', 'Hahaha, very cute!  Is there a blue ribbon under that tail and were any lions or cats hurt in  the process?  An 8', '2004-12-20 10:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1070414, 128954, 12448, '<td valign="top">Now if you had put a 3 to the right and made it Ho to the 3rd power...............  LOL!  I love this, the lighting seems a bit dark on the right but otherwise very well done!  A 9</td>', 'Now if you had put a 3 to the right and made it Ho to the 3rd power...............  LOL!  I love this, the lighting seems a bit dark on the right but otherwise very well done!  A 9', '2004-12-20 10:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1070418, 128849, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  The background is a bit distracting, al little more blur to diffuse it''s effect and the tail not being cut off (that always bothers me with birds)  would have made this a 10, as is an 8</td>', 'Very nice!  The background is a bit distracting, al little more blur to diffuse it''s effect and the tail not being cut off (that always bothers me with birds)  would have made this a 10, as is an 8', '2004-12-20 10:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1070419, 128915, 12448, '<td valign="top">HAHAH!  I love it!  If the person below was sharper this would be a 10, but it looks like some motion blur and the hand with the roller is a bit blown out, just a tad, an 8</td>', 'HAHAH!  I love it!  If the person below was sharper this would be a 10, but it looks like some motion blur and the hand with the roller is a bit blown out, just a tad, an 8', '2004-12-20 10:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1070427, 128573, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very nice compliment to the original.  The light seems just a tad bright on the blue pencil causing a illusional effect on the left side but otherwise, very well done.   A 9</td>', 'Very nice compliment to the original.  The light seems just a tad bright on the blue pencil causing a illusional effect on the left side but otherwise, very well done.   A 9', '2004-12-20 10:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1070448, 129495, 25655, '<td valign="top">A great replica but it looks too yellow on my screen.<br/>I wish I could see this one a bit more white-balanced...<br/>Over all a nice work. 7<br/></td>', 'A great replica but it looks too yellow on my screen.I wish I could see this one a bit more white-balanced...Over all a nice work. 7', '2004-12-20 10:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1070454, 128633, 25655, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!<br/>I really like the idea and the presentation!</td>', 'Beautiful!I really like the idea and the presentation!', '2004-12-20 11:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1070458, 129185, 25655, '<td valign="top">Great presentation! although... if the little guy was actually running, I would expect to find the shoe-prints much farther away from each other. Just a thought. Yet, a wonderful photo!</td>', 'Great presentation! although... if the little guy was actually running, I would expect to find the shoe-prints much farther away from each other. Just a thought. Yet, a wonderful photo!', '2004-12-20 11:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1070459, 129224, 6667, '<td valign="top">We obviously both liked casualguys entry.  Best of luck.  It wasn''t easy, was it?</td>', 'We obviously both liked casualguys entry.  Best of luck.  It wasn''t easy, was it?', '2004-12-20 11:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1070462, 129158, 25655, '<td valign="top">i wish the words were a bit more in focus. They are too blurry IMO.<br/>Still, a nice photo and great focus on the kid''s face.</td>', 'i wish the words were a bit more in focus. They are too blurry IMO.Still, a nice photo and great focus on the kid''s face.', '2004-12-20 11:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
