(1071064, 129331, 19978, '<td valign="top">Ah, Miss Parker''s original 36B was one of my original favorite photos on this site. Your reproduction does an admiral job of replicating the magic of her shot. The tones are wonderful. Very nicely done!</td>', 'Ah, Miss Parker''s original 36B was one of my original favorite photos on this site. Your reproduction does an admiral job of replicating the magic of her shot. The tones are wonderful. Very nicely done!', '2004-12-20 17:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
