(1071120, 129259, 11793, '<td valign="top">the colors are very nice, but the noise really hurts it.<br/>i had a hard time getting enough light and low ISO for these shots.<br/>i have given up until i get a decent flash...<br/></td>', 'the colors are very nice, but the noise really hurts it.i had a hard time getting enough light and low ISO for these shots.i have given up until i get a decent flash...', '2004-12-20 18:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
