(1071251, 128223, 16739, '<td valign="top">real nice 6</td>', 'real nice 6', '2004-12-20 20:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071254, 129214, 16739, '<td valign="top">very nice   6</td>', 'very nice   6', '2004-12-20 20:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071258, 129193, 16739, '<td valign="top">good try , lips need more color and alittle washed out , other wise very nice</td>', 'good try , lips need more color and alittle washed out , other wise very nice', '2004-12-20 20:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071260, 128796, 6999, '<td valign="top">Well, I suppose you must have been waiting for my comment. Rather an odd feeling for me, actually. <br/> <br/>I like the confusion of this - it has made me look for a while; I like the mouse reference. I''m not convinced about your tonality, especially with the base shot so recently in our minds I think you print of Jon''s shot lacks the blue punch. The blue/orange combination was a very important element of the success of my shot, I thought, and this would have benefitted from something more ''real world'' i think. I like your approach though.</td>', 'Well, I suppose you must have been waiting for my comment. Rather an odd feeling for me, actually.  I like the confusion of this - it has made me look for a while; I like the mouse reference. I''m not convinced about your tonality, especially with the base shot so recently in our minds I think you print of Jon''s shot lacks the blue punch. The blue/orange combination was a very important element of the success of my shot, I thought, and this would have benefitted from something more ''real world'' i think. I like your approach though.', '2004-12-20 20:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071262, 129182, 16739, '<td valign="top">Now thats funny !!  came back to bump up , you made me laugh again</td>', 'Now thats funny !!  came back to bump up , you made me laugh again', '2004-12-20 20:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071263, 128773, 16739, '<td valign="top">very good , good idea</td>', 'very good , good idea', '2004-12-20 20:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071265, 129477, 6999, '<td valign="top">Validated? People don''t understand refraction then, obviously. Stron shot - love the choice of words too. Pity it was so far up the page, actually, as the actual heart itself in your shot isn''t a strong as the original; enough to make the impact though, all the same.</td>', 'Validated? People don''t understand refraction then, obviously. Stron shot - love the choice of words too. Pity it was so far up the page, actually, as the actual heart itself in your shot isn''t a strong as the original; enough to make the impact though, all the same.', '2004-12-20 20:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071271, 128772, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not a bad go - the sininess of the jugs I don''t like as much as the original, and it''s also a shame to my eye that you couldn''t have found a curved background, but otherwise it''s a pretty solid copy.</td>', 'Not a bad go - the sininess of the jugs I don''t like as much as the original, and it''s also a shame to my eye that you couldn''t have found a curved background, but otherwise it''s a pretty solid copy.', '2004-12-20 20:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071276, 129443, 6999, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s the moment you (might have been) waiting for. How did you get on with the paper tearing? Have to do it more than once?<br/> <br/>You have made me laugh though. My reservations would be about technical qualities such as the brightness of the base image you''ve used, and the clarity of that arse. in the end, I jjust have to say thanks, though.</td>', 'Well, it''s the moment you (might have been) waiting for. How did you get on with the paper tearing? Have to do it more than once? You have made me laugh though. My reservations would be about technical qualities such as the brightness of the base image you''ve used, and the clarity of that arse. in the end, I jjust have to say thanks, though.', '2004-12-20 20:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071281, 129456, 6999, '<td valign="top">Honest, slightly brutal, impeccable, absolutely inspired, and very very beautiful photography. A marvellous, marvellous image. Awesome. The first outright ten i''ve given in bloody ages. +fav immediately. Rocks.</td>', 'Honest, slightly brutal, impeccable, absolutely inspired, and very very beautiful photography. A marvellous, marvellous image. Awesome. The first outright ten i''ve given in bloody ages. +fav immediately. Rocks.', '2004-12-20 20:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071289, 129207, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised there weren''t more versions actually - though i think it is a rashly high quality image to take on :-) Criticisms: the pose isn''t as proud, as perfect as the original - this looks uncomfortable where Heida''s model looks perfectly at ease. The burning of the sky is overdone - yes, even for a version of a Heida shot. Not bad beyond those things though.</td>', 'I''m surprised there weren''t more versions actually - though i think it is a rashly high quality image to take on :-) Criticisms: the pose isn''t as proud, as perfect as the original - this looks uncomfortable where Heida''s model looks perfectly at ease. The burning of the sky is overdone - yes, even for a version of a Heida shot. Not bad beyond those things though.', '2004-12-20 20:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071291, 129296, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good strong light, effectively caught. you placing of your depth of field in regard to your composition is also strong - quite a nice shot. Sufferes in comparison with Thamer''s original, if only in sheer sense of scale, but I like what you gain in detail.</td>', 'Good strong light, effectively caught. you placing of your depth of field in regard to your composition is also strong - quite a nice shot. Sufferes in comparison with Thamer''s original, if only in sheer sense of scale, but I like what you gain in detail.', '2004-12-20 20:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071293, 128796, 8860, '<td valign="top">A vast improvement on a totally crap challenge entry. I hope you do considerably better with this infinitely superior submission.</td>', 'A vast improvement on a totally crap challenge entry. I hope you do considerably better with this infinitely superior submission.', '2004-12-20 20:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071294, 128661, 6999, '<td valign="top">dang, I never knew how this fitted into the ''mundane'' challenge, in the first place - at least tis certainly fits here :-) I still find it an uncomfortable shape, compositionally, though this is a good approach. I personally think it needs to be set against the genuine mundanity of te Brum skyline to stand the best chance of working as a shot, but never got a chance in the week i spent there last August. Good work here though.</td>', 'dang, I never knew how this fitted into the ''mundane'' challenge, in the first place - at least tis certainly fits here :-) I still find it an uncomfortable shape, compositionally, though this is a good approach. I personally think it needs to be set against the genuine mundanity of te Brum skyline to stand the best chance of working as a shot, but never got a chance in the week i spent there last August. Good work here though.', '2004-12-20 20:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071295, 129260, 6999, '<td valign="top">Just doesn''t have the clarity, and sense of composition, of the original. Great image to choose though.</td>', 'Just doesn''t have the clarity, and sense of composition, of the original. Great image to choose though.', '2004-12-20 20:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071297, 129452, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good light, good set-up; hasn''t quite the hyper-designer look of the original, which was what to my mind gave it it''s impact. The bug, though, looks no more appetising :-)</td>', 'Good light, good set-up; hasn''t quite the hyper-designer look of the original, which was what to my mind gave it it''s impact. The bug, though, looks no more appetising :-)', '2004-12-20 20:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071304, 129377, 6999, '<td valign="top">Moody, sexy, wonderfully lit and shot. Almost an exact copy, except for the even more moody lighting.</td>', 'Moody, sexy, wonderfully lit and shot. Almost an exact copy, except for the even more moody lighting.', '2004-12-20 20:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071307, 129182, 6999, '<td valign="top">Oh man, funniest shot in the bunch. Love this - so very nearly offensive, nd just so funny. Good luck.</td>', 'Oh man, funniest shot in the bunch. Love this - so very nearly offensive, nd just so funny. Good luck.', '2004-12-20 20:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071312, 128768, 1368, '<td valign="top">LoL Thats a cute little devil! I can almost feel the horns growing out of his head :D hehe Nice picture :D</td>', 'LoL Thats a cute little devil! I can almost feel the horns growing out of his head :D hehe Nice picture :D', '2004-12-20 20:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071313, 129091, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think you''ll get bashed on this one, just for taking a radically different approach from most. A shame, but this shot actually doesn''t have anything like the impact of JJ''s shot, simply in terms of tonality and composition, if nothing else.</td>', 'I think you''ll get bashed on this one, just for taking a radically different approach from most. A shame, but this shot actually doesn''t have anything like the impact of JJ''s shot, simply in terms of tonality and composition, if nothing else.', '2004-12-20 20:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071315, 128954, 6999, '<td valign="top">Cleaner and neater than the original, I would say. Unfortunately, I don''t see that you''ve moved things on much from what was never a particular favourite of mine anyhow. Technically, it''s beautifully done, absolutely flawless I would say. It still elicits a big ''so what?'' from me though.</td>', 'Cleaner and neater than the original, I would say. Unfortunately, I don''t see that you''ve moved things on much from what was never a particular favourite of mine anyhow. Technically, it''s beautifully done, absolutely flawless I would say. It still elicits a big ''so what?'' from me though.', '2004-12-20 20:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071319, 129378, 6999, '<td valign="top">Immediately referencible (?), but different, and well done. the colours lack some punch I think - for this kind of set-up thing shouldn''t you want big vibrant shades? The greens and yellows look a bit washed out to me.</td>', 'Immediately referencible (?), but different, and well done. the colours lack some punch I think - for this kind of set-up thing shouldn''t you want big vibrant shades? The greens and yellows look a bit washed out to me.', '2004-12-20 20:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071321, 128384, 6999, '<td valign="top">Whoa. <br/> <br/>To quote a , er, film.<br/> <br/>This has the look of a 5x7 or even 4x6 torn photo - mine was 11x8 and thus getting the line of the tear much easier (ah, the voice of expertise). You''ve certainly got the colour balance of the top image - that''s an important element to me - but your lower is a bit confused. Very flattering to be imitated however.</td>', 'Whoa.  To quote a , er, film. This has the look of a 5x7 or even 4x6 torn photo - mine was 11x8 and thus getting the line of the tear much easier (ah, the voice of expertise). You''ve certainly got the colour balance of the top image - that''s an important element to me - but your lower is a bit confused. Very flattering to be imitated however.', '2004-12-20 20:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071330, 129013, 15305, '<td valign="top">I wanted to do this exact same idea, maybe the only difference would be the banana not being peeled or biten. I couldn''t do it on time, but I''m really glad someone came up with the same idea. I hope you do well in the challenge!!</td>', 'I wanted to do this exact same idea, maybe the only difference would be the banana not being peeled or biten. I couldn''t do it on time, but I''m really glad someone came up with the same idea. I hope you do well in the challenge!!', '2004-12-20 21:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071365, 129162, 15511, '<td valign="top">Great parody!</td>', 'Great parody!', '2004-12-20 22:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071421, 128773, 24494, '<td valign="top">sorry but you just killed that picture (i''m gonna go cry now)</td>', 'sorry but you just killed that picture (i''m gonna go cry now)', '2004-12-20 23:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
