(1071848, 129362, 16488, '<td valign="top">A nice reinterpretation of "Over the Top" -- it continues the story nicely.  I really like your lighting, it has a lot of "pop" but in comparison with the other, it seems that the backlighting and use of negative space is what helped create the sucess of the original.  However, your image stands nicely on its own.  Lovely texture and detail in this image!</td>', 'A nice reinterpretation of "Over the Top" -- it continues the story nicely.  I really like your lighting, it has a lot of "pop" but in comparison with the other, it seems that the backlighting and use of negative space is what helped create the sucess of the original.  However, your image stands nicely on its own.  Lovely texture and detail in this image!', '2004-12-21 10:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
