(1072501, 129331, 14620, '<td valign="top">If I was to enter this challenge this is the one I was thinking about doing.  You did an excellent job recreating the original even down to the "jewelry".  Well done!</td>', 'If I was to enter this challenge this is the one I was thinking about doing.  You did an excellent job recreating the original even down to the "jewelry".  Well done!', '2004-12-21 19:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
