(1072504, 128658, 14620, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on jj''s shot.  I would''ve loved to recreate his skylight shot or any of his shots for that matter, had I the skills for it.  I like your twist on his idea.  Very nice colors at work in this scene and a lovely composition.</td>', 'Interesting take on jj''s shot.  I would''ve loved to recreate his skylight shot or any of his shots for that matter, had I the skills for it.  I like your twist on his idea.  Very nice colors at work in this scene and a lovely composition.', '2004-12-21 19:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
