(1073637, 128772, 11738, '<td valign="top">Could have used a secondary light source from up above and a little in the front to give a bit more definition on the front of the vases.  Also, a bit stronger light source from the right maight have lessened the intensity of "dropinto black" when going from right to left.  But what do I know....</td>', 'Could have used a secondary light source from up above and a little in the front to give a bit more definition on the front of the vases.  Also, a bit stronger light source from the right maight have lessened the intensity of "dropinto black" when going from right to left.  But what do I know....', '2004-12-22 08:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1073639, 129162, 11738, '<td valign="top">The whole image is tad too dark.  Excellent idea through and good work of highlighting the paint cannister and "spray".  Nice choice of colour too.</td>', 'The whole image is tad too dark.  Excellent idea through and good work of highlighting the paint cannister and "spray".  Nice choice of colour too.', '2004-12-22 08:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1073642, 129193, 14603, '<td valign="top">Unless, I`m mistaken, this is "Veronique" ?<br/>Undoubtedly, the best of the tributes to this great shot.<br/>Good luck</td>', 'Unless, I`m mistaken, this is "Veronique" ?Undoubtedly, the best of the tributes to this great shot.Good luck', '2004-12-22 08:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
