(1075020, 129462, 30712, '<td valign="top">Beautifully put together.  Very effective lighting.</td>', 'Beautifully put together.  Very effective lighting.', '2004-12-23 02:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075022, 128645, 30712, '<td valign="top">The shape and colour hold the attention well here.</td>', 'The shape and colour hold the attention well here.', '2004-12-23 02:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075023, 129362, 30712, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful.</td>', 'Simply beautiful.', '2004-12-23 02:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075024, 129454, 30712, '<td valign="top">The colours stand out so well against the solid black background.</td>', 'The colours stand out so well against the solid black background.', '2004-12-23 02:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075025, 129400, 30712, '<td valign="top">The limited colour range and composition make this very compelling.</td>', 'The limited colour range and composition make this very compelling.', '2004-12-23 02:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075026, 128890, 30712, '<td valign="top">Good enough to eat.  The roundness of the fruit comes out well here.</td>', 'Good enough to eat.  The roundness of the fruit comes out well here.', '2004-12-23 02:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075027, 129310, 30712, '<td valign="top">Well controlled depth of field here.  Just right.</td>', 'Well controlled depth of field here.  Just right.', '2004-12-23 02:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075028, 129023, 30712, '<td valign="top">A good advertising shot. Clear and to the point.</td>', 'A good advertising shot. Clear and to the point.', '2004-12-23 02:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075029, 128144, 30712, '<td valign="top">A bit of coloured light would have lifted this shot to higher realms.</td>', 'A bit of coloured light would have lifted this shot to higher realms.', '2004-12-23 02:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075030, 129259, 30712, '<td valign="top">The mix of colours and their relative positions make for a delightful picture.</td>', 'The mix of colours and their relative positions make for a delightful picture.', '2004-12-23 02:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075032, 129475, 30712, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Just the right amound of light penetration.</td>', 'I like it.  Just the right amound of light penetration.', '2004-12-23 02:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075033, 128981, 30712, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft lighting here.  The two colours go together so well.</td>', 'Lovely soft lighting here.  The two colours go together so well.', '2004-12-23 02:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075034, 129000, 30712, '<td valign="top">Well captured and controlled.  An excellent silhouette.</td>', 'Well captured and controlled.  An excellent silhouette.', '2004-12-23 02:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075035, 129158, 30712, '<td valign="top">This looks serious and thought provoking.  The amount of detail in the background is just right.</td>', 'This looks serious and thought provoking.  The amount of detail in the background is just right.', '2004-12-23 02:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075036, 129193, 30712, '<td valign="top">This intense eye contract is compelling.</td>', 'This intense eye contract is compelling.', '2004-12-23 02:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075037, 128863, 30712, '<td valign="top">Like the silences in music the black areas are so important.</td>', 'Like the silences in music the black areas are so important.', '2004-12-23 02:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075039, 128878, 30712, '<td valign="top">Very successful</td>', 'Very successful', '2004-12-23 02:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075040, 128661, 30712, '<td valign="top">Exended depth of field and just the right light angle.</td>', 'Exended depth of field and just the right light angle.', '2004-12-23 02:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075041, 128456, 30712, '<td valign="top">Cleverly done.</td>', 'Cleverly done.', '2004-12-23 02:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075051, 129456, 22479, '<td valign="top">Oh my...this is really a parody to the extreme! This photo has a lot of shock value. Well executed.</td>', 'Oh my...this is really a parody to the extreme! This photo has a lot of shock value. Well executed.', '2004-12-23 03:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075052, 128633, 22479, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. Worthy of the original in every aspect. Well done.</td>', 'Wonderful. Worthy of the original in every aspect. Well done.', '2004-12-23 03:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075054, 129208, 22479, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t quite have the same color saturation. A shame, because I really like this a lot. You could have easily matched Dan''s colors with a quick levels/hue/saturation modification in Photoshop, after cleaning up the image a bit with a noise removal tool (which you may not have access to, so I won''t hold that against ya).</td>', 'Doesn''t quite have the same color saturation. A shame, because I really like this a lot. You could have easily matched Dan''s colors with a quick levels/hue/saturation modification in Photoshop, after cleaning up the image a bit with a noise removal tool (which you may not have access to, so I won''t hold that against ya).', '2004-12-23 03:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075055, 129193, 22479, '<td valign="top">Good entry. Doesn''t quite have the same excellence in lighting as kiwiness'' original but a good portrait on its own merit.</td>', 'Good entry. Doesn''t quite have the same excellence in lighting as kiwiness'' original but a good portrait on its own merit.', '2004-12-23 03:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075056, 129270, 22479, '<td valign="top">A worthy recreation of Jacko''s original. Same lovely colors and lighting. Well executed.</td>', 'A worthy recreation of Jacko''s original. Same lovely colors and lighting. Well executed.', '2004-12-23 03:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075058, 128456, 22479, '<td valign="top">Excellent recreation of jpoole''s illusion entry. I prefer this one to the original due to better lighting and focus. One recommendation: use heavier stock paper.</td>', 'Excellent recreation of jpoole''s illusion entry. I prefer this one to the original due to better lighting and focus. One recommendation: use heavier stock paper.', '2004-12-23 04:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075059, 129377, 22479, '<td valign="top">Quite an excellent recreation of John''s excellent Defining Features entry. This is very comparable in technical quality. Lighting is just a little bit more harsh. Well done.</td>', 'Quite an excellent recreation of John''s excellent Defining Features entry. This is very comparable in technical quality. Lighting is just a little bit more harsh. Well done.', '2004-12-23 04:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075061, 129113, 22479, '<td valign="top">Wonderful combination of lighting and exposure. I like your creativity here. I doubt DrJOnes would use naked Barbies, though lol. But I can understand your choice of props here. Fantastic.</td>', 'Wonderful combination of lighting and exposure. I like your creativity here. I doubt DrJOnes would use naked Barbies, though lol. But I can understand your choice of props here. Fantastic.', '2004-12-23 04:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075063, 128768, 22479, '<td valign="top">Clever and humerous take on the famous DPC original. Brought a chuckle out of me so this is a success in my book.</td>', 'Clever and humerous take on the famous DPC original. Brought a chuckle out of me so this is a success in my book.', '2004-12-23 04:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075066, 129214, 22479, '<td valign="top">Excellent creativity! I think you executed this one very well. Must have been difficult to get the water drop just right. I wish you had addressed the glare on the table surface. Other than that, executed to perfection.</td>', 'Excellent creativity! I think you executed this one very well. Must have been difficult to get the water drop just right. I wish you had addressed the glare on the table surface. Other than that, executed to perfection.', '2004-12-23 04:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075067, 129379, 19959, '<td valign="top">LOL. I actually Scanned my cat and considered entering that!!! It was funny but hardly a ''great'' photograph. This is great.</td>', 'LOL. I actually Scanned my cat and considered entering that!!! It was funny but hardly a ''great'' photograph. This is great.', '2004-12-23 04:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075068, 128633, 19959, '<td valign="top">Great take on a DPChallenge classic.</td>', 'Great take on a DPChallenge classic.', '2004-12-23 04:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075071, 129362, 19503, '<td valign="top">Congrats on an amazing capture! It looks as if the snail is melting with the plant.. very cool :) I also love your creativity with this shot. However, I think that the background might take away some attention from the snail &amp; plant, maybe a more solid background would have worked better, or simply just a little darker tone, otherwise I think it''s perfect. GJ!</td>', 'Congrats on an amazing capture! It looks as if the snail is melting with the plant.. very cool :) I also love your creativity with this shot. However, I think that the background might take away some attention from the snail & plant, maybe a more solid background would have worked better, or simply just a little darker tone, otherwise I think it''s perfect. GJ!', '2004-12-23 04:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075098, 129239, 27812, '<td valign="top">bumping up.... actually not bad at all.</td>', 'bumping up.... actually not bad at all.', '2004-12-23 06:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075156, 129182, 16406, '<td valign="top">superb shot... a mix of bilbo baggins and one mel brooks character....</td>', 'superb shot... a mix of bilbo baggins and one mel brooks character....', '2004-12-23 09:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075175, 129474, 19978, '<td valign="top">Outstanding concept and execution. I like this as much as SCalvert''s original, and the paint roller was genius!</td>', 'Outstanding concept and execution. I like this as much as SCalvert''s original, and the paint roller was genius!', '2004-12-23 09:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075177, 129113, 19978, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, beautiful, beautiful. I sorta wish is was an actual model though. The color play and gradients are breathtaking. Very well done tribute.</td>', 'Beautiful, beautiful, beautiful. I sorta wish is was an actual model though. The color play and gradients are breathtaking. Very well done tribute.', '2004-12-23 09:32:47.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1075180, 128895, 19978, '<td valign="top">Another excellent chance for a side-by-side comparison. This is an excellent tribute to Remie''s original. I get the sense that your lights were not quite as powerful as his (maybe trying to avoid blowing out the whites?). The result is that your reds are not quite as vibrant either, but it''s still an excellent photo, and one you should be proud of. 7.</td>', 'Another excellent chance for a side-by-side comparison. This is an excellent tribute to Remie''s original. I get the sense that your lights were not quite as powerful as his (maybe trying to avoid blowing out the whites?). The result is that your reds are not quite as vibrant either, but it''s still an excellent photo, and one you should be proud of. 7.', '2004-12-23 09:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075182, 128573, 19978, '<td valign="top">Another great chance for side-by-side comparisons during a challenge. Your Remie tribute is very well done, with vibrant colors, and the added  bonus of using your own colors. I''m bumping this one to an 8 because of the vivid colors and the way the whites, just short of being blown, merge so well together with pencil and background. Well done!</td>', 'Another great chance for side-by-side comparisons during a challenge. Your Remie tribute is very well done, with vibrant colors, and the added  bonus of using your own colors. I''m bumping this one to an 8 because of the vivid colors and the way the whites, just short of being blown, merge so well together with pencil and background. Well done!', '2004-12-23 09:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075205, 128633, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry to see you sacrifice a filter for this but this photo works.  However, the original is better composed and in my personal opinion a red colour of the filter would have worked better since most people (myself included) associate love with red.  I gave it a 7.</td>', 'Sorry to see you sacrifice a filter for this but this photo works.  However, the original is better composed and in my personal opinion a red colour of the filter would have worked better since most people (myself included) associate love with red.  I gave it a 7.', '2004-12-23 10:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075212, 129214, 27482, '<td valign="top">Awesome, great tribute and by itself a flawless shot, could be in any catalouge of commercial I could imagine.  10</td>', 'Awesome, great tribute and by itself a flawless shot, could be in any catalouge of commercial I could imagine.  10', '2004-12-23 10:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075223, 129493, 27482, '<td valign="top">I´m not saying that I could do better, I actually tried this shot myself but the outcome wasn´t good so I just decided not to post it but this is so far from doing the original justice.  Not a bad effort, but compared to the original, just a 4 in my opinion.</td>', 'I´m not saying that I could do better, I actually tried this shot myself but the outcome wasn´t good so I just decided not to post it but this is so far from doing the original justice.  Not a bad effort, but compared to the original, just a 4 in my opinion.', '2004-12-23 10:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075233, 128336, 29462, '<td valign="top">Superb 10 10 10</td>', 'Superb 10 10 10', '2004-12-23 11:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075234, 129270, 29462, '<td valign="top">absolutley striking would look so good hung on the wall</td>', 'absolutley striking would look so good hung on the wall', '2004-12-23 11:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075236, 129331, 29462, '<td valign="top">Great composition</td>', 'Great composition', '2004-12-23 11:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075238, 128875, 27482, '<td valign="top">As far as I can see this is the same house that won in "tacky holiday decorations" but that shot has so much more quality.  The sharpness and colours and exposure are  better in the original and also the composition being a bit wider with no cars also makes that a better shot.<br/> <br/>Anyway, not bad, but not good either so I gave it a 5.  Merry christmas!</td>', 'As far as I can see this is the same house that won in "tacky holiday decorations" but that shot has so much more quality.  The sharpness and colours and exposure are  better in the original and also the composition being a bit wider with no cars also makes that a better shot. Anyway, not bad, but not good either so I gave it a 5.  Merry christmas!', '2004-12-23 11:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075239, 129333, 27482, '<td valign="top">In my opinion better than the original, but the fact that I know it´s copied drags it down a notch so I "only" gave it a 9.  Hope you do well.</td>', 'In my opinion better than the original, but the fact that I know it´s copied drags it down a notch so I "only" gave it a 9.  Hope you do well.', '2004-12-23 11:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075242, 128645, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not as sharp or well focused as the original but it´s a lovely shot.  I am not sure it would have been better but one thing I like about the original is that it´s not quite so "up close" but this works also.</td>', 'Not as sharp or well focused as the original but it´s a lovely shot.  I am not sure it would have been better but one thing I like about the original is that it´s not quite so "up close" but this works also.', '2004-12-23 11:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075261, 128336, 27482, '<td valign="top">It´s a bit to clean, to static for my taste or even to "perfect".  No little droplets inbetween the bigger droplets and IMO that is what makes the original shot work so well.  Not bad though, way better than what I came up with, gave it a 7.</td>', 'It´s a bit to clean, to static for my taste or even to "perfect".  No little droplets inbetween the bigger droplets and IMO that is what makes the original shot work so well.  Not bad though, way better than what I came up with, gave it a 7.', '2004-12-23 12:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075266, 129113, 27482, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  Great technique, only wish it had been a real model but other than that, perfect.  10</td>', 'Awesome!  Great technique, only wish it had been a real model but other than that, perfect.  10', '2004-12-23 12:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075295, 128661, 12160, '<td valign="top">Stunning! Beautifully done. 9 and marked as favorite.</td>', 'Stunning! Beautifully done. 9 and marked as favorite.', '2004-12-23 13:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075298, 128954, 23478, '<td valign="top">Excellent, I really like this.</td>', 'Excellent, I really like this.', '2004-12-23 13:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075303, 129459, 23478, '<td valign="top">I like it.</td>', 'I like it.', '2004-12-23 13:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075304, 129208, 23478, '<td valign="top">Very well done.</td>', 'Very well done.', '2004-12-23 13:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075305, 129259, 23478, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2004-12-23 13:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075306, 129447, 23478, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, tough one to imitate.</td>', 'Hmmm, tough one to imitate.', '2004-12-23 13:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075308, 129232, 23478, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2004-12-23 13:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075436, 129459, 30214, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and implementation. Is the reddish cast on purpose? I tink it would be better without it.</td>', 'Excellent idea and implementation. Is the reddish cast on purpose? I tink it would be better without it.', '2004-12-23 14:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075440, 129443, 30214, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea, but implementaiton lacks crispiness of the original</td>', 'Excellent idea, but implementaiton lacks crispiness of the original', '2004-12-23 14:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075444, 129156, 30214, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo</td>', 'Excellent photo', '2004-12-23 14:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075450, 129310, 30214, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, the implementation lacks the perfection of the original. You probably colored over the background, and it shows. By the way, why with  this dull brownish  color? Also, forgot to colorize  the pink spot in the top of the picture.</td>', 'Nice idea, the implementation lacks the perfection of the original. You probably colored over the background, and it shows. By the way, why with  this dull brownish  color? Also, forgot to colorize  the pink spot in the top of the picture.', '2004-12-23 14:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075511, 129092, 14986, '<td valign="top">Being a guitar player, I realy like these kind''s of shots.   The knob on the rear guitar is distracting IMO, however.  I would have cloned it out.  I would also like to see some way to lessen that shadow.    Still, nice lines and colors.</td>', 'Being a guitar player, I realy like these kind''s of shots.   The knob on the rear guitar is distracting IMO, however.  I would have cloned it out.  I would also like to see some way to lessen that shadow.    Still, nice lines and colors.', '2004-12-23 16:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075513, 128964, 14986, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure this is entered in the right challenge?   Feel free to pm me if I''m mistaken.</td>', 'I''m not sure this is entered in the right challenge?   Feel free to pm me if I''m mistaken.', '2004-12-23 16:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075516, 128768, 14986, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, but I think technically it could be done better.  I''m not crazy about the rock or whatever the doll is on.  I think the dodging/burning is not done as artistically as I''d like...kinda streaky looking.  The shot did bring a smile, however!  :)</td>', 'Cute idea, but I think technically it could be done better.  I''m not crazy about the rock or whatever the doll is on.  I think the dodging/burning is not done as artistically as I''d like...kinda streaky looking.  The shot did bring a smile, however!  :)', '2004-12-23 16:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075518, 129258, 14986, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure which photo inspired this one, but that doesn''t affect my scoring.  The ground appears overly bright and the face has a greenish/yellow tinge to it.  I like the motion and the expression.</td>', 'I''m not sure which photo inspired this one, but that doesn''t affect my scoring.  The ground appears overly bright and the face has a greenish/yellow tinge to it.  I like the motion and the expression.', '2004-12-23 16:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075521, 128875, 14986, '<td valign="top">Not quite as clear as the original, and the cars and people detract.   Cool idea to go to the exact house though!  An option most of us didn''t have :)</td>', 'Not quite as clear as the original, and the cars and people detract.   Cool idea to go to the exact house though!  An option most of us didn''t have :)', '2004-12-23 16:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075523, 129207, 14986, '<td valign="top">I like having the snow in the pic.   I would have like the model turned a bit more sideways (as was the original).    It also seems like the dodging and burning isn''t done quite as artistically....not as much "character" left in the sky.     A very nice attempt, though.    It stands well on it''s own, and it is difficult to be compared to the original!</td>', 'I like having the snow in the pic.   I would have like the model turned a bit more sideways (as was the original).    It also seems like the dodging and burning isn''t done quite as artistically....not as much "character" left in the sky.     A very nice attempt, though.    It stands well on it''s own, and it is difficult to be compared to the original!', '2004-12-23 16:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075525, 129296, 14986, '<td valign="top">Personally, I don''t care for the crop...I would like to see a bit more mailboxes.  Still, I think these are actually better than the original boxes.  I like the detail on these.   Nicely done.</td>', 'Personally, I don''t care for the crop...I would like to see a bit more mailboxes.  Still, I think these are actually better than the original boxes.  I like the detail on these.   Nicely done.', '2004-12-23 16:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075530, 128883, 14986, '<td valign="top">I think this needed a better draping of the material.   Other than that I like the shot a lot.</td>', 'I think this needed a better draping of the material.   Other than that I like the shot a lot.', '2004-12-23 16:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075533, 128890, 14986, '<td valign="top">Terrific copy!</td>', 'Terrific copy!', '2004-12-23 16:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075539, 129271, 14986, '<td valign="top">Lighting on this one isn''t quite as good, imo.  Still, in it''s own right, I think this is well done.  Good clarity, focus and tones.   I just like the original one a little better because of the brightness.</td>', 'Lighting on this one isn''t quite as good, imo.  Still, in it''s own right, I think this is well done.  Good clarity, focus and tones.   I just like the original one a little better because of the brightness.', '2004-12-23 16:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075544, 128456, 14986, '<td valign="top">Actually, I like this better than the original.  I like the lighting better with these lesser shadows.   Well done.</td>', 'Actually, I like this better than the original.  I like the lighting better with these lesser shadows.   Well done.', '2004-12-23 16:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075548, 129056, 14986, '<td valign="top">How cheesy....I love it!   Nicely done technically as well.</td>', 'How cheesy....I love it!   Nicely done technically as well.', '2004-12-23 16:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075551, 128796, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very good twist to Ed Clarke´s idea and a good reminder for the DPC community.  -10</td>', 'Very good twist to Ed Clarke´s idea and a good reminder for the DPC community.  -10', '2004-12-23 16:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075554, 129474, 24642, '<td valign="top">A very clever idea to take Shannon''s shot back to what many thought it was.</td>', 'A very clever idea to take Shannon''s shot back to what many thought it was.', '2004-12-23 17:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
