(1075565, 129392, 14986, '<td valign="top">Maybe just a little too saturated on the colors, but I like th crop, lkghting,  and set up better than the original.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Maybe just a little too saturated on the colors, but I like th crop, lkghting,  and set up better than the original.  Nicely done.', '2004-12-23 17:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
