(1075591, 129377, 14986, '<td valign="top">Just a little better lighting and this one would have been dead-on to the original.  I think a lot of work went into this shot.   It does appear just a little dark for my tastes, but still nicely done.</td>', 'Just a little better lighting and this one would have been dead-on to the original.  I think a lot of work went into this shot.   It does appear just a little dark for my tastes, but still nicely done.', '2004-12-23 17:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
