(1075765, 129163, 30861, '<td valign="top">It may not be the greatest, but it would be greater if the very distracting branch tips on left were not there, and arguably if the branches on right were gone as well. It''s a nice mood regardless. The tripling of the reflection is strange. I don''t know if I like that or not.</td>', 'It may not be the greatest, but it would be greater if the very distracting branch tips on left were not there, and arguably if the branches on right were gone as well. It''s a nice mood regardless. The tripling of the reflection is strange. I don''t know if I like that or not.', '2004-12-23 20:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
