(1075768, 129492, 30861, '<td valign="top">Glass stem is not vertical, nor glass rim horizontal. That''s a critical falw in an image of this sort. separation of glass rim from background could be better-handled. I''m not sure the refraction of light onto the background is desirable here.</td>', 'Glass stem is not vertical, nor glass rim horizontal. That''s a critical falw in an image of this sort. separation of glass rim from background could be better-handled. I''m not sure the refraction of light onto the background is desirable here.', '2004-12-23 20:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
