(1075886, 129377, 23458, '<td valign="top">Wow this is so very nearly Identical. I really don''t know how to score it - I think I prefer the images in this challenge that provide something approaching an interesting spin on things. But for sheer skill in imitation I have to give it an 8. Make that a nine - that is one sexy stomach.</td>', 'Wow this is so very nearly Identical. I really don''t know how to score it - I think I prefer the images in this challenge that provide something approaching an interesting spin on things. But for sheer skill in imitation I have to give it an 8. Make that a nine - that is one sexy stomach.', '2004-12-23 21:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075888, 128768, 23458, '<td valign="top">Technically this ain''t great - sky is grainy and cartman looks out of focus - but on the other hand, its a really great parody. So this is a nine.</td>', 'Technically this ain''t great - sky is grainy and cartman looks out of focus - but on the other hand, its a really great parody. So this is a nine.', '2004-12-23 21:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
