(1076213, 129454, 13749, '<td valign="top">so confused right now.. not sure how this was done.  wish i knew what challenge this was copying, so that i could compare it.  the colors add an important bit of life to this image - without them, it would be very dull (and dark).</td>', 'so confused right now.. not sure how this was done.  wish i knew what challenge this was copying, so that i could compare it.  the colors add an important bit of life to this image - without them, it would be very dull (and dark).', '2004-12-24 05:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076214, 128890, 13749, '<td valign="top">i was gonna say that the border is a bit hefty, but i checked and it''s pretty close to the original.  i like this even better than the original (though i must admit that they have two different looks, and i suppose it could just be a matter of taste).  apple on front left looks slightly bruised :( - just a minor detail, though.</td>', 'i was gonna say that the border is a bit hefty, but i checked and it''s pretty close to the original.  i like this even better than the original (though i must admit that they have two different looks, and i suppose it could just be a matter of taste).  apple on front left looks slightly bruised :( - just a minor detail, though.', '2004-12-24 05:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076215, 129459, 13749, '<td valign="top">wow, actually looks like the pencil is on top of the finger - good work.</td>', 'wow, actually looks like the pencil is on top of the finger - good work.', '2004-12-24 05:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076217, 129113, 13749, '<td valign="top">great gordon effect.. not so great dr jones effect (not so fond of the barbie).  still, a techincally sound shot that deserves a decent score.</td>', 'great gordon effect.. not so great dr jones effect (not so fond of the barbie).  still, a techincally sound shot that deserves a decent score.', '2004-12-24 05:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
