(1076559, 128961, 13749, '<td valign="top">wish you had balanced it out slightly better (left is cropped out, but right is not).  otherwise, good colors, dof and sharpness.</td>', 'wish you had balanced it out slightly better (left is cropped out, but right is not).  otherwise, good colors, dof and sharpness.', '2004-12-24 14:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
