(1078409, 129377, 19503, '<td valign="top">Yay.. my first ribbon!<br/> <br/>Thank you everyone for your uplifting comments :) It was fun to get a ribbon even though the idea was not mine.<br/> <br/>The original shot by smokeditor is soo nice, and I am really glad to hear that he liked my outtake as well :p. <br/> <br/>There were soo many good pictures in this contest, and I really would have love to see someone with a original idea getting this one, I almost didn''t want to score this high.. lol<br/> <br/>If I had a original or funny idea, I would have tried that instead. But I learned alot by doing this, I think everyone did who competed. <br/> <br/>Thanks Again!</td>', 'Yay.. my first ribbon! Thank you everyone for your uplifting comments :) It was fun to get a ribbon even though the idea was not mine. The original shot by smokeditor is soo nice, and I am really glad to hear that he liked my outtake as well :p.  There were soo many good pictures in this contest, and I really would have love to see someone with a original idea getting this one, I almost didn''t want to score this high.. lol If I had a original or funny idea, I would have tried that instead. But I learned alot by doing this, I think everyone did who competed.  Thanks Again!', '2004-12-27 01:23:36.000000', NULL, 0),
