(1079011, 129295, 8610, '<td valign="top">Deja Vu to you Jacko - <br/>I can''t believe this only received therteen 10s. It was my favorite this week. You got robbed dude. The shot was too funny for me to watch. Great job.. got 1 more in score then the orginal.. well done :D</td>', 'Deja Vu to you Jacko - I can''t believe this only received therteen 10s. It was my favorite this week. You got robbed dude. The shot was too funny for me to watch. Great job.. got 1 more in score then the orginal.. well done :D', '2004-12-27 15:26:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1079018, 129163, 5044, '<td valign="top">Harold, thanks for the tribute. I was quite shocked to see anybody want to copy one of my shots. As you probably noticed, mine had the same lack of sharpness in the reflection. There seems to be some ghosting happening, probably from not shooting the mirror head on. <br/> <br/>Cheers and good luck in future challenges.<br/> <br/>Mario</td>', 'Harold, thanks for the tribute. I was quite shocked to see anybody want to copy one of my shots. As you probably noticed, mine had the same lack of sharpness in the reflection. There seems to be some ghosting happening, probably from not shooting the mirror head on.  Cheers and good luck in future challenges. Mario', '2004-12-27 15:38:04.000000', NULL, 0),
