(1513636, 129331, 30018, '<td valign="top">Frederico, I like this shot a lot, in fact it''s just become one of my favorites.  Others have said it, and it is the first thing that I noticed.  The shadow behind the bra.  Gotta Go.  The bright jeans don''t bother so much, but it might have been a better image with a more even tonal quality, which would have meant more detail in those jeans.  But, dude, I still love this shot!<br/></td>', 'Frederico, I like this shot a lot, in fact it''s just become one of my favorites.  Others have said it, and it is the first thing that I noticed.  The shadow behind the bra.  Gotta Go.  The bright jeans don''t bother so much, but it might have been a better image with a more even tonal quality, which would have meant more detail in those jeans.  But, dude, I still love this shot!', '2005-07-06 18:35:35.000000', NULL, 0),
